{"t":"BEN","made":"2026-11-28 02:27","name":"Franklin Templeton Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","employees":9900,"hq":"San Mateo, CA, United States","website":"https://www.franklintempleton.com/corporate","summary_en":"Franklin Templeton Inc. is a publicly owned asset investment manager. Through its subsidiaries, the firm provides its services to individuals, institutions, pension plans, trusts, and partnerships. It launches equity, fixed income, balanced, and multi-asset mutual funds through its subsidiaries. The firm invests in the public equity, fixed income, and alternative markets. Franklin Resources, Inc. was founded in 1947 and is based in San Mateo, California with an additional office in Calgary, Alberta; Dubai, United Arab Emirates; Edinburgh, Midlothian; Fort Lauderdale, Florida; Hyderabad, India; London, Greater London; Rancho Cordova, California; Shanghai, Shanghai Province; Singapore; Stamford, Connecticut; and Vienna.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Franklin Templeton Inc.는 공개 자산 투자 관리자입니다. 자회사를 통해 회사는 개인, 기관, 연금 계획, 신탁 및 파트너십에 서비스를 제공합니다. 자회사를 통해 주식, 채권, 균형 및 다중 자산 뮤추얼 펀드를 출시합니다. 이 회사는 공공 지분, 채권 및 대체 시장에 투자합니다. Franklin Resources, Inc.는 1947년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 산마테오에 본사를 두고 있으며 앨버타주 캘거리에도 추가 사무실이 있습니다. 두바이, 아랍에미리트; 에딘버러, 미들로디언; 플로리다주 포트로더데일; 인도 하이데라바드; 런던, 그레이터 런던; 캘리포니아 주 랜초 코르도바; 상하이, 상하이 지방; 싱가포르; 코네티컷 주 스탬포드; 그리고 비엔나.","val":{"price":34.18,"mcap":17517250560.0,"pe":17.350254,"fpe":9.402664,"peg":0.4461,"ps":1.860509,"pb":1.4728315,"ev_ebitda":10.97,"div":3.93,"beta":1.602,"hi52":36.79,"lo52":22.34},"fin":{"rev":9415300096.0,"rev_g":0.039,"eps_g":2.421,"gross":0.38317,"op":0.16624,"net":0.114209995,"roe":0.104169995,"fcf":-3664987392.0,"cash":3227800064.0,"debt":3830799872.0,"de":26.123,"eps":1.97,"feps":3.63514},"own":{"short":0.041100003,"inst":0.49106,"insider":0.48329},"analyst":{"n":14,"mean":37.07143,"median":36.0,"high":44.0,"low":30.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.64286,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"